<title>FINLAND: UPM SALES, PROFIT BY DIVISION.</title>
<headline>UPM SALES, PROFIT BY DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest industry group UPM-Kymmene Oy on Thursday gave the following breakdown of its sales and operating profit in the first half this year (million markka): </p>
<p> SALES			  1-6/97  1-6/96  Change(pct) 1-12/96</p>
<p> Magazine papers	    5,362   5,451   -1.6	  11,172</p>
<p> Newsprint		    2,772   3,068   -9.6	   5,780</p>
<p> Fine papers		  3,662   3,071   19.2	   6,220</p>
<p> Packaging materials	2,457   2,441    0.7	   4,664</p>
<p> Sawn timber		  2,223   1,779   25.0	   3,725</p>
<p> Plywood			1,733   1,632    6.2	   3,144</p>
<p> Special products	   2,304   1,896   21.5	   3,574</p>
<p> Chemical pulp		1,963   2,135   -8.1	   4,106</p>
<p> Other			  6,409   5,844    9.7	  10,525 @</p>
<p> Internal sales	    -6,638  -6,362    4.3	 -11,759</p>
<p> Businesses sold	    4,173   5,217  -20.0	  10,606</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> TOTAL			 26,420  26,172    0.9	   51,757</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT:	   1-6/97   1-6/96     1-12/96</p>
<p> Magazine papers		 315    1,136	2,072</p>
<p> Newsprint			 211	674	1,044</p>
<p> Fine papers		     234	 47	   85</p>
<p> Packaging materials	   161	231	  382</p>
<p> Sawn timber		     157	-33	  -48</p>
<p> Plywood			   131	 92	  139</p>
<p> Special products		185	217	  339</p>
<p> Chemical pulp		  -111	-17	 -176</p>
<p> Other (1)		     2,828	401	  867 @</p>
<p> Businesses sold		 318	441	  887</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> TOTAL			   4,429    3,189	 5,591</p>
<p>(1) Operating profit includes gains from the sale of fixed assets (net).</p>
